{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"PingFang HK\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>楊明與莊思明昨日（<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>2</span>日）於馬來西亞吉隆坡舉行盛大婚禮，在全場親友的見證下正式結為夫婦。婚禮儀式上，這對攜手走過多年的新人甜蜜交換誓詞，句句真情流露，更連咀三次，閃爆全場。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"87c2f3b0-6514-4e13-9560-fadd5e7bff97.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20261TITpBS9ro1785732154.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"87c2f3b0-6514-4e13-9560-fadd5e7bff97.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">莊思明首先多謝老公楊明對自己的包容，「唔經唔覺一齊<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>10</span>年，冇想過同一個人生活<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>10</span>年係咩感覺，直至我遇到你，我知道我脾氣唔好，成日鬧你，有時你都會鬧番我，我好多謝你永遠都會做道歉嗰個先，好多謝你包容我嘅一切同遷就我，好寵愛我。我知道你為我改變咗好多，你由從前乜都唔諗，每日只係嘻嘻哈哈嘅大細路，變成一個願意去承擔所有責任，每日都好努力去顧照我嘅大細路。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">她又向楊明承諾：「今日我正式成為你太太，我應承你我會盡量少啲鬧你，多啲愛錫你，同埋包容你最難頂嘅拖延症。」台下賓客聞言即時發笑及拍手，莊思明續說：「我會一直做你最強大嘅後盾，等你可以放膽去追尋你自己嘅夢想，喺未來日子入面我會拖住你隻手一齊面對所有快樂同挑戰，多謝你令我成為你嘅女主角，<span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>I love You</span>。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"99bc0904-e41f-45e4-84d6-5debd9779344.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20264Fh83gl19N1785732154.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"99bc0904-e41f-45e4-84d6-5debd9779344.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">楊明亦真情流露，「我記得我哋剛一齊時，我拍劇時揸電單車炒車入咗醫院，你唔單止喺醫院日日陪我，我出院後，你每日都幫我洗傷口，你唔怕個傷口恐怖，其實嗰時好感動，應該唔係咁多人做到，何況我哋剛喺埋一齊，到我喺人生最低落嘅時間，你唔止要對住一個冇嚟神氣，同日日借酒消愁嘅男友，仲要面對外界好多嘅壓力，我知道你係好辛苦，但你喺辛苦入面都諗好多活動同飯局，好多健康嘅運動畀我去做，令我冇時間去鑽牛角尖或者諗啲唔開心嘅嘢，呢啲我全部都知道，呢段時間我真係好多謝你，冇咗都唔知點過，我曾經喺你爸爸面前應承過你，我會照顧你一生一世，今晚多謝你畀機會我開始呢個承諾，多謝。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩人隨後交換戒指，並在眾人歡呼下當眾接吻3次，合共近20秒，閃爆全場！最搞笑的是身為婚禮司儀的莊思敏不知是否因為太激動，竟將合法「丈夫」成「妻子」，「你願唔願意嫁楊明為你嘅合法妻子？」鬧出爆笑烏龍。莊思明亦即時叫對方冷靜，場面相當好笑。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f91ae904-aca7-4d3e-9845-b14d36d15809.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026PnRyabBHlN1785732154.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f91ae904-aca7-4d3e-9845-b14d36d15809.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a7b97e59-c401-481b-a773-c5fcb46494e3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026JaEpFCV3P31785732154.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a7b97e59-c401-481b-a773-c5fcb46494e3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;'></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T05:18:58.420712+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":822,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}